      "entries": [
        "30 feet. The churning water around the bone ship tinges red with seeping blood. A living creature that enters water in the aura sees visions of itself drowning in the blood and must attempt a DC 37 Will save. After attempting this saving throw, the creature is temporarily immune for 1 hour. On a failure, the creature becomes frightened 2 (frightened 4 on a critical failure) and stunned 1, and it takes a –4 status penalty to Athletics checks to Swim."
